    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Synaptic Nexus",
    "summary": "As each battle round starts, you may pick 1 Synaptic Imperative not yet picked this battle. Until that round ends, each **TYRANIDS** unit of yours gets its benefit while within your army's [Synapse Range](vsdata:ability/tyranids.synapse):\n\n- **Synaptic Augmentation**: its models get an invulnerable save of 5+.\n- **Surging Vitality**: +1 to its Advance and **Charge rolls**.\n- **Goaded to Slaughter**: +1 to Hit for its models' [melee attacks](vsdata:core-rule/making-attacks).",
